  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of a common tangent to the curves, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math> is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0076_235f99fa072a.png\" style=\"width: 371px; height: 214px;\" /></p><p>A tangent to the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></math> can be written as:<br /><math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> &hellip;. (1)<br />It will touch the hyperbola <math><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math> if the quadratic <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>4</mn></math> has coincident roots,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Equating of common tangent will be <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
  }
}